{"2968230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RUN Gor I", "steam_appid": 2968230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ru</strong>n GOR I is a first-person psychological horror video game. Face your inner self. Are you capable of controlling your own being? Eat, and keep eating. It will be the only thing that keeps your heart beating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968230/extras/a9d499ff98988fee7b8e9af50f619984.avif?t=1788229057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968230/extras_big/a9d499ff98988fee7b8e9af50f619984.webp?t=1788229057 width=1560 height=817 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to take control. Dodge the enemies and avoid taking damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968230/extras/043bf4bc1678c65d9d52d40a1f7748cf.avif?t=1788229057\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968230/extras_big/043bf4bc1678c65d9d52d40a1f7748cf.webp?t=1788229057 width=1560 height=817 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the right chemical elements from the food for your body. You don't have much time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: Keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD:</strong> Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Mouse Button:</strong> Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Mouse Button:</strong> Secondary Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift:</strong> Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space:</strong> Jump / Wall Climb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968230/e